<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS HIGHER.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-3/4 higher at $45 in New York on Friday and rose further to $45-1/4.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 206.8 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki Nokia A was trading at 207.00 markka, up 6.00 markka, shortly before the local close.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
